offset_bottom = 601.0
text = "\"What is the point of rewinding the clock if my dearest is not there to spend eternity with?\"
\"Why call you here?\"
\"Should I have faced death knowing I did my worst?\"

\"This I know: It is human to regret.\"
\"Captain Argo and the others are only lying to themselves.\"
\"I don't have monetary problems like Fairuz. Nor personal struggles like Deniz or Emi. William's case is beyond my lifetime still.\"
\"Family. It is a crime how I have mistreated kin.\"
\"I regret it all.\"
\"Let me try again.\""
label_settings = SubResource("LabelSettings_wm4do")
